          "quote": "[2020-09-29T15:02:05] Elena Horvat: It's definitely important for us. However, we're also considering how user-friendly these solutions are, especially during the initial adoption phase. We\u2019ve seen some challenges with that in the past.\n[2020-09-29T15:02:25] Chidi Onyekachi: I understand. While our solutions focus heavily on functionality and innovation, we are taking steps towards improving user experience, ensuring the transition is as seamless as possible. We also provide comprehensive training programs to support your team throughout the process.",
